    "media:imagetext": "SANIBEL-CAPTIVA REAL ESTATE\nMARGUERITE SIMONDS\nPAUL SIMONDS\nRegistered Real Estate Brokers\nMOHAWK 3-6555\nSanibel Island, Florida\nJuly 5, 1961\nIr. Willis Combs\nSanibel, Florida\nDear Willis,\nThe parcel we spoke of up north of the main road contains\napproximately 234 acres. It is owned by two separate parties\nand is listed with us\nfor sale at $350. per acre. If your\nfriends would\ncare to make an offer on these\nproperties,\naccompanied with an earnest money deposit, we will be most\nhappy to submit it to the owners. The offers and the earnest\nmoney deposits should be made separately, and each to be\ncontingent upon the other.\nIf there is any further information you may want about these\nproperties, please let us know.\nSincerely\na0.\nJas. S. Pickens\nAssociate.",
